-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-07: approved; automated
              replay, JNext pace and real-loader checks the same day

  Replay      8 RZX recordings from the release, 96,520 frames: original and
              patched replayed side by side, every frame all registers
              including R and all 128K of RAM (bank 1, the music, too)
              compared; at each screen copy the ULA plus sprites equal the
              original's picture; 10 of 10 deliberately broken builds
              detected.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104: default and Enhanced reach play; boot and NEXLOAD
              start checked; ROM paths checked over NextZXOS v2.09 and v2.10
              ROMs.

  Coverage    Title, round picture, intro theatre, play in every round (one
              recording uses a test cheat to clear each round with one dot),
              interludes, ending, deaths, game over. Every hook at four
              incoming CPU speeds and across R's wrap; all 86 figure frames
              and the score forms at the view's edges against the original
              plotter.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
